===Etymology===
A [[Appendix:Glossary#borrowing|borrowing]], via other European languages, probably originally from {{etyl|es|lv}} or {{etyl|ca|lv}} {{m|es|Andorra}}, a word of disputed origin. The most probable hypothesis is that it comes from {{etyl|eu|lv}} {{m|eu|andurrial||shrub-covered land}}, but it is also possible that the source is {{etyl|ar|lv}} {{m|ar|الدرا||the forest}} or {{cog|es|andar||to walk}}.

